><span>linkedin.com/in/dimasangkasa</span></a></li><li class="contact-item"><a href="https://github.com/angkasa27" aria-label="Link: https://github.com/angkasa27" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>github.com/angkasa27</span></a></li><li class="contact-item"><a href="https://asaa.dev" aria-label="Link: https://asaa.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>asaa.dev</span></a></li></ul></div></header><div class="layout-body"><section class="section" data-section="summary"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Summary</h2><div class="rich-text"><p>Software Engineer with 5+ years of experience specializing in frontend development for enterprise web applications. Skilled in building responsive, high-quality interfaces with modern frameworks, improving performance, and creating maintainable component-based systems. Comfortable working beyond the frontend when needed, including API integration, system design, and deployment, to deliver reliable end-to-end products.</p></div></section><div><section class="section" data-section="workExperience"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Work Experience</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">Nusantara Commerce</h3><em class="meta italic">Lead Frontend Engineer</em><span class="meta">Jakarta, Indonesia</span></div><div class="item-header-side"><div class="item-date">Mar 2022 - Current</div></div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Led the migration of the customer storefront from legacy React pages to Next.js App Router, improving Core Web Vitals and reducing average page load time by 38%.</li><li>Partnered with product and design teams to launch a reusable component library used by 6 squads, cutting feature delivery time by 25%.</li><li>Mentored 4 engineers through architecture reviews, testing standards, and rollout plans for high-traffic releases.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="skills"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Skills</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><h3 class="item-title">Frontend Engineering</h3><span class="meta">React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Design Systems, Vitest, Playwright</span></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="projects"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Projects</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://portfolio.example.dev/projects/seller-analytics-dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Seller Analytics Dashboard</a></h3><div class="item-date">Jan 2024 - Oct 2024</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Built a role-based analytics dashboard for marketplace sellers with interactive charts, exports, and saved filters.</li><li>Implemented data fetching and cache strategies that reduced dashboard query time from 5.2s to 1.9s on high-volume accounts.</li><li>Delivered an accessible UI and keyboard-first navigation, passing internal accessibility QA for core flows.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="education"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Education</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">Institut Teknologi Bandung</h3><em class="meta italic">B.S. in Informatics</em><span class="meta">Bandung, Indonesia</span><span class="meta">GPA: 3.78 / 4.00</span></div><div class="item-date">Aug 2015 - May 2019</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Focused on software engineering, human-computer interaction, and distributed systems.</li><li>Capstone project: designed a web-based scheduling platform used by 3 departments during pilot adoption.</li></ul></div></