ems</li><li class="tag">Vitest</li><li class="tag">Playwright</li></ul></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="projects"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Projects</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://portfolio.example.dev/projects/seller-analytics-dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Seller Analytics Dashboard<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right link-marker" aria-hidden="true"></svg></a></h3><div class="item-date">Jan 2024 - Oct 2024</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Built a role-based analytics dashboard for marketplace sellers with interactive charts, exports, and saved filters.</li><li>Implemented data fetching and cache strategies that reduced dashboard query time from 5.2s to 1.9s on high-volume accounts.</li><li>Delivered an accessible UI and keyboard-first navigation, passing internal accessibility QA for core flows.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="education"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Education</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">B.S. in Informatics</h3><div class="meta">Institut Teknologi Bandung</div><div class="meta">GPA: 3.78 / 4.00</div></div><div class="item-header-side"><div class="item-date">Aug 2015 - May 2019</div><div class="meta">Bandung, Indonesia</div></div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Focused on software engineering, human-computer interaction, and distributed systems.</li><li>Capstone project: designed a web-based scheduling platform used by 3 departments during pilot adoption.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="publications"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Publications</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://medium.com/@dimasangkasa/frontend-performance-ecommerce" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Practical Frontend Performance for Indonesian E-Commerce<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right link-marker" aria-hidden="true"></svg></a></h3><div class="meta">Tech in Asia Community</div></div><div class="item-date">Sep 2024</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Wrote a practical guide on bundle optimization, image strategy, and rendering patterns based on production incidents and measurable outcomes.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="certifications"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Certifications</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/12345678-90ab-cdef-1234-567890abcdef" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AWS Certified Developer - Associate<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right link-marker" aria-hidden="true"></svg></a></h3><div class="meta">Amazon Web Services</div><div class="meta">Credential ID: AWS-DEV-2024-5521</div></div><div class="item-date">Jul 2024</div></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="awards"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-