ction></div><div><section class="section" data-section="awards"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading"><span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award" aria-hidden="true"></svg></span><span>Awards</span></h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">Product Impact Award</h3><div class="meta">Nusantara Commerce</div></div><div class="item-date">Dec 2024</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Recognized for leading checkout performance improvements that increased conversion by 6.4% during the year-end campaign period.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="languages"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading"><span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-languages" aria-hidden="true"></svg></span><span>Languages</span></h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item item-row"><h3 class="item-title">English</h3><span class="chip">Professional working proficiency</span></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="references"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading"><span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote" aria-hidden="true"></svg></span><span>References</span></h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><h3 class="item-title">Pertiwi Putri</h3><div class="meta">Engineering Director, Nusantara Commerce</div><div class="meta">pertiwi.putri@nusantaracommerce.co.id · +62 812-4455-6677</div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="organizationVolunteering"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading"><span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-hand-heart" aria-hidden="true"></svg></span><span>Organizations &amp; Volunteering</span></h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">Volunteer Mentor</h3><div class="meta">Indonesia React Community</div></div><div class="item-header-side"><div class="item-date">Feb 2021 - Current</div><div class="meta">Jakarta, Indonesia</div></div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Mentor junior developers through monthly frontend clinics covering React fundamentals, testing, and portfolio reviews.</li><li>Co-organized 8 meetups with hands-on workshops attended by more than 400 participants.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></article>"`;

